title: Tiddler Types

An item's type is a plain tag. The built-in type tags are members of the `$:/tags/hypergsd/Type` tag list, which drives refresh gating, the modal's Type dropdown and tag application on creation.

! Built-in types

;[[Action|Action]]
:Tag `$:/GSD/Action` — the basic unit of work.
;[[Project|Project]]
:Tag `$:/GSD/Project` — groups actions, subprojects and references.
;[[Contact|Contact]] (ships from the [[HyperGSD Contacts|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contacts/readme]] sub-plugin)
:Tag `$:/GSD/Contact` — a person things can be delegated to.
;[[Context|Context]] (ships from the [[HyperGSD Contexts|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contexts/readme]] sub-plugin)
:Tag `GSD/Contexts` (the dashboard tiddler is the tag list) — where/how an action happens; multiple contexts per action.
;[[Reference|Reference]] (ships from the [[HyperGSD References|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-references/readme]] sub-plugin)
:Tag `$:/GSD/Reference` — supporting material attached to a project.

! Extension types

New types need no code changes: create a tiddler tagged `$:/tags/hypergsd/Type` with a unique `hgsd-type` field — see [[Type tag list|Type tag list]].